{"id":"cb1680e640d075a4","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-aleph-fixed-point.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal2 Aleph Fixed Point","display":"df-zfc-ordinal2-aleph-fixed-point — ZFC Ordinal2 Aleph Fixed Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-aleph-fixed-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal2-aleph-fixed-point"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal2-aleph-fixed-point — ZFC Ordinal2 Aleph Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-aleph-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal2-aleph-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal2-aleph-fixed-point — ZFC Ordinal2 Aleph Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md\">../batch17/58-df-aleph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_\\alpha\">\\(\\aleph_\\alpha\\)</span> (aleph function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md\">../batch17/58-df-aleph.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2AlephFixedPoint}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2AlephFixedPoint}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 是序数类缩写，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal.md\">58-df-ordinal.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}aleph\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2AlephFixedPoint}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\aleph_\\alpha=\\alpha\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}aleph\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2AlephFixedPoint}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\aleph_\\alpha=\\alpha\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ordinal-domain conjunct prevents the fixed-point equation from being applied outside the domain of the aleph recursion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02